+ *  Reordering
+ *  [A,B,C,D,E] with indexes [0,4,1,2,3] yields 
+ *  [A,E,B,C,D]
+ *  In other words g[0]&lt;--g[0], g[1]&lt;--g[4], g[2]&lt;--g[1], g[3]&lt;--g[2], g[4]&lt;--g[3].
+ * </pre>
+ * 
+ * </td>
+ * </table>
+ * <p>
+ * Here are some example swappers:
+ * <table>
+ * <td class="PRE">
